# macOS Finder cruft — keep it out of the .claude/ drop-in payload so it never
# rides along when the folder is copied into another repo.
.DS_Store
# Nested module CLAUDE.md notes stay out of the payload; the ROOT shim is tracked (FIX 4,
# route A). The old bare `CLAUDE.md` rule silently swallowed the root shim at commit time —
# commit 28b8b28's message says it added CLAUDE.md; its diff shows the rule ate it.
CLAUDE.md
!/CLAUDE.md
